							Does that mean you&#039;re voting for Republicans even if you know nothing about them?<br />Or do you mean you&#039;ve looked at all the Republicans on the ballot for each office?<br /><br />I would love to see the country be more conservative, but not if it means voting for a stupid Republican over a smart Democrat or other party candidate.
