							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Actually the reason I am voting a straight ticket this election is that I usually vote democratic for the state I live in.&nbsp; Democrats screwed up medicaid, housing and 4 wheel tax in my state. I have kept up on politics for the past year. It scares me to death to think Kerry will be President!<br /><br />Colleen
