							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1150.msg12253#msg12253"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1150.msg12253#msg12253">Re: Stupid People</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #58 on:</b> October 31, 2004, 03:41:12 am &#187;</span></td>
